Network condition simulator for tests (patches/net-0012), as melee-unlocked's hle/slippi_net.cpp has it: MELEE_NET_LOSS_PCT=P drops
P % of received datagrams before ENet reads them; MELEE_NET_LAG_MS=N and MELEE_NET_JITTER_MS=J hold each received match packet
N + 0..J ms, in order. Unset, nothing changes. Applied by ../net_sources.sh after net-0010.
